# Frontend build-time config. Copy to .env for local overrides if needed.
#
# Leave EMPTY for local dev — Vite proxies /api, /healthz, /metrics to the
# backend on :4000 automatically (see vite.config.js).
#
# For a deployed static frontend (Render/Vercel/etc.), set this to the deployed
# backend origin so the app calls the real API instead of same-origin /api:
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://capitaa-backend.onrender.com
#
# NOTE: Vite inlines this at BUILD time — set it in your host's env vars and
# trigger a fresh build (clear cache) for it to take effect.
VITE_API_BASE=
